{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297250","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297250","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1029725001:1":{"text":"手紙を受け取ってすぐに、ルカと迎えの準備を整えておいた。","source_cn":"收到你们的来信，我和卢卡就在准备迎接你们了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5EB326924860D7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029725002:1":{"text":"ほぼ予定通りに着いたということは、ここ最近は航路もだいぶ穏やかみたいだな。","source_cn":"和预期的时间差不多，看起来最近航路风平浪静。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9205AD1366F7777C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1029725002":{"text":"ほぼ予定通りに着いたということは、ここ最近は航路もだいぶ穏やかみたいだな。","source_cn":"和预期的时间差不多，看起来最近航路风平浪静。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9205AD1366F7777C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029725003:1":{"text":"ああ。あたしやラスティーアンカーのみんなも、あんたに会えるのを楽しみにしていたよ。","source_cn":"好久不见，我与锈锚港的所有人都非常期待与你重逢。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x25BB643EE7F43CE3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ああ。あたしやラスティーアンカーのみんなも、あんたに会えるのを楽しみにしていたよ。","female":"ああ。あたしやラスティーアンカーのみんなも、あんたに会えるのを楽しみにしていたよ。","variant_male_record_index":"102493","variant_female_record_index":"102494","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029725005:1":{"text":"それで、そちらのご友人が手紙に書かれていた――","source_cn":"那么，这位新朋友就是信中提到的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CF8D3BB862D239B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029725006:0":{"text":"初めまして、オイラはロワン。今回はミスリル商会を代表して、ラスティーアンカーの市場調査をしに来たんだ。","source_cn":"你好，我是罗万，这次代表秘银商会，想要调查下锈锚港这里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC598A4A9E668231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029725007:0":{"text":"罗万向索尼娅和罗万快速地介绍了他的计划、愿景与本次行动的目标。","source_cn":"罗万向索尼娅和卢卡快速地介绍了他的计划、愿景与本次行动...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x4810EAAE66B83766","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029725008:0":{"text":"――というわけで、すべて上手くいけば、ミスリル商会の後ろ盾を得たうえで、ラスティーアンカーは聖石町と安定した交易ルートを築くことができるはずだ。","source_cn":"——综上所述，如果一切顺利，有秘银商会背书，锈锚港就可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x373718D2CFB170A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029725009:0":{"text":"悪くない話だ。なるべく早く計画書を確認して、こちらが提供できる船のリストをまとめておこう。","source_cn":"棒极了，那么，我会尽快研究下你的计划书，并且整理出目前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FA968A9FA059580","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029725010:0":{"text":"商品に関しては……ロワンに街の中を見て回って、決めてもらうのがいいだろう。","source_cn":"至于货品……就在锈锚港内到处考察下吧，看看罗万有什么想...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAF3CB3F13697572F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"商品に関しては……ロワンに街の中を見て回って、決めてもらうのがいいだろう。","female":"商品に関しては……ロワンに街の中を見て回って、決めてもらうのがいいだろう。","variant_male_record_index":"102502","variant_female_record_index":"102503","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029725011:0":{"text":"だがそうなると、あたしがずっとついているのは難しいな……ルカ、頼めるか？","source_cn":"唔，但这样的话，我恐怕没法陪你们同行太久……卢卡？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x568A9235852AC9AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1029725012:0":{"text":"任せてください。","source_cn":"没问题，交给我就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB89C1F29EF0BA4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1029725013:0":{"text":"では決まりだな。まずはあたしが簡単に街を案内しよう。詳しい紹介はあとでルカに任せる。","source_cn":"那就这么定了，我先陪诸位到处逛逛，后续详细的介绍就交给...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7B8A8D5AA8A8529","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1029725014:0":{"text":"相変わらずの行動力ですね、ソニアさん……","source_cn":"还是一样雷厉风行啊，索尼娅。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4036400F3105E1F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1029725015:0":{"text":"まさに理想的なビジネスパートナーだな。この前のババリアも、ここのみんなも、話が早くて本当に助かるよ。","source_cn":"这正是我理想的合作对象——无论此前的蛮血部落还是锈锚港...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B558270354C1699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1029725016:0":{"text":"それじゃ、ラスティーアンカーで一番代表的な市場に案内してもらえるかな？","source_cn":"那么，接下来能否拜托二位带我到你们这里比较有代表性的市...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA7B2631334178DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1029725017:0":{"text":"よし、ならこの街で一番大きい魚市場に案内しよう。こっちだ。","source_cn":"当然，请跟我来，锈锚港最大的鱼市就在那边。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59D27DB3E787367B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"久しぶりだな、ソニア。","source_cn":"好久不见，索尼娅！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA27F887A106B449C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"久しぶりだな、ソニア。","female":"久しぶりね、ソニア。","variant_male_record_index":"59680","variant_female_record_index":"59681","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1029725004:1":{"text":"悪くない。あんたも相変わらず元気にやっているようだな。","source_cn":"很好，看到你也像之前一样健康，想必你的日子也一样不错。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7B8FB9F23006D783","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"悪くない。あんたも相変わらず元気にやっているようだな。","female":"悪くない。あんたも相変わらず元気にやっているようだな。","variant_male_record_index":"102495","variant_female_record_index":"102496","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:1:2":{"text":"調子はどうだ？","source_cn":"最近过得怎么样？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x99314CDA77023902","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"調子はどうだ？","female":"調子はどう？","variant_male_record_index":"72846","variant_female_record_index":"72847","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"ソニア","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:罗万":{"text":"ロワン","source":"罗万","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"ナレーション","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"ルカ","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":5}}